## FAQ (verbatim from the product's own locale file, `en.ts`)

Q1. What does RegexProof generate?
A1. A dialect-aware regex draft with part-by-part explanation, ECMAScript vs PCRE traps, and ReDoS heuristics — decision-support, not a formal verifier.

Q2. Is this legal advice or a certification?
A2. No. Outputs are decision-support drafts. Have counsel and risk owners review before production. We do not claim ISO, CMP, or regulator certification.

Q3. Can I cancel anytime?
A3. Yes. Self-serve plans cancel anytime; access continues until period end.

Q4. Do I need a credit card to start?
A4. No. Start with email signup or Demo mode in the studio, then upgrade when ready.

Q5. Do I need my own ChatGPT / OpenAI subscription?
A5. No for Free/Pro. AI runs are included in your plan (fair use) via our platform key. Enterprise can optionally bring your own OpenAI key (BYOK) — configure it at /settings (key stays server-side only).

Q6. What is Fair Use / what if I hit the AI limit?
A6. Pro includes about 300 AI generations/month (and a daily cap) on gpt-4o-mini. If you hit the fair-use limit, Studio returns a mock/demo result until the daily or monthly reset — or upgrade / use Enterprise BYOK for heavier volume.

Q7. Is checkout secure?
A7. Payments are processed by Waffo Pancake (merchant of record).

Q8. What happens after I pay?
A8. You receive access confirmation; fulfillment is tracked via webhook + order logs.

